  "description": "Demolition of existing outbuilding and canopy and construction of a single storey rear outbuilding ancillary to main dwelling",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be occupied or used at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 33 Mayesbrook Road and as shown on the plans hereby approved.&nbsp;",
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p>The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:</p><p>A00 - Location Plan - 27/02/2026<br>A02 - Proposed Floor Plan - 22/04/2026<br>A04 - Proposed Roof Plan - 22/04/2026<br>A06 - Proposed Elevations - 22/04/2026<br>C00 - Proposed Block Plan - 27/02/2026</p><p>No other drawings or documents apply.</p>"
